<title>BELGIUM: NATO-Russia talks set for February 23.</title>
<headline>NATO-Russia talks set for February 23.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>NATO Secretary-General Javier Solana will meet Russian Foreign Minister Yevgeny Primakov in Brussels on February 23 for a second round of talks on a new deal between the former foes, alliance diplomats say.</p>
<p>The talks will centre on a permanent consultative mechanism between Moscow and the alliance, offered to try and meet Russian objections to NATO's planned expansion into former communist Europe.</p>
</text>
